          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 6v6m0 0v6m0-6h6m-6 0H6\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-800\">Buat Rule Baru</p><p class=\"text-xs text-indigo-600\">Tipe CONDITION</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tambah Kondisi LOGICAL",
          "desc": "Di Step 2 (Build Flow), klik \"Add Condition\" dan pilih tipe \"LOGICAL\". Kondisi LOGICAL berfungsi sebagai container untuk menggabungkan kondisi lain dengan operator AND/OR. Simpan tanpa mengubah pengaturan default.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-800\">LOGICAL</p><p class=\"text-xs text-blue-600\">Container untuk multiple kondisi</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tambah Kondisi CONSTANT",
          "desc": "Tambah kondisi CONSTANT baru. Atur: atribut = \"amount\", operator = \">\", nilai = \"1000000\".\nHubungkan node CONSTANT ke node LOGICAL (drag dari kanan CONSTANT ke kiri LOGICAL).",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-teal-50 rounded-lg border border-teal-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800\">CONSTANT</p><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-600\">amount > 1000000</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Tambah Kondisi CONTAINS",
          "desc": "Tambah kondisi CONTAINS baru. Atur: atribut = \"merchant_category\", nilai = [\"ECOM\", \"DIGITAL\"].\nHubungkan node CONTAINS ke node LOGICAL juga.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-violet-50 rounded-lg border border-violet-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-violet-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-violet-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 7v10l8 4V11L4 7zm16 0l-8 4v10l8-4V7zm0 0l-8-4-8 4\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-violet-800\">CONTAINS</p><p class=\"text-xs text-violet-600\">merchant_category ∈ [ECOM, DIGITAL]</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Atur Operator LOGICAL",
          "desc": "Klik edge dari CONSTANT ke LOGICAL. Ubah operator menjadi \"AND\".\nKlik edge dari CONTAINS ke LOGICAL. Ubah operator menjadi \"AND\" juga.\nSekarang rule akan mendeteksi: transaksi > 1 Juta AND kategori ECOM/DIGITAL.",
